{"v":4,"catch":"終極破磚傳奇——人人都知道這個名字！","desc":"《ARKANOID》是 TAITO 於 1986 年推出的打磚塊遊戲。\n駕駛太空船「VAUS」，利用能量球彈射來擊碎太空牆。\n你的目標是逃離扭曲迷宮的維度，並返回母艦「ARKANOID」。收集強化道具將能助你一臂之力，輕鬆征服每個關卡！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-05-07","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cea5eccfce9247f5c9d3f14694f2b3367d0275de1d833fbeba5bf04b683be5d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21f308c63ea2eeeedee770a50f440e94ca3cca6fbf6152b1ab326c21349becdb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7de2d344f7a07de33ccb739baed4f6460e3b50f40da37cccb788cb65eef701f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c30df14089d2a1e5206316a3a1fafbfbe62b2b4f3d61e483ffdf3a03ae5e3caf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4ac8f97d323aa8f5c4eb55e3afb5fd59619ba64f80a5d1e480f78795fb80a155.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d8f303cbf3f0d6b2ebd324573be2fbdb88294fbb04f15c1a5782df78ac5f31c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d2a0259ba000","dlc":[]}